---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import DecoRule from "../components/DecoRule.astro";
---
<Layout title="Villa Theo — Die Lage">

  <section class="section page-header">
    <div class="container page-header-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-de>Standort</span>
      <span class="eyebrow" data-en>Location</span>
      <h1 data-de>Die Lage</h1>
      <h1 data-en>Location</h1>
      <DecoRule />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section lage-content">
    <div class="container lage-inner">
      <div class="lage-text">
        <p data-de>
          Die Villa Theo liegt in der Haderslebener Straße 26, 12163 Berlin — im Bezirk Steglitz-Zehlendorf, an der Grenze zu Dahlem. Einem der grünsten und ruhigsten Teile der Stadt. Die Lage verbindet das Beste beider Welten: urbane Erreichbarkeit und grüne Stille.
        </p>
        <p data-en>
          Villa Theo is at Haderslebener Straße 26, 12163 Berlin — in the Steglitz-Zehlendorf district, on the border with Dahlem. One of the city's greenest and quietest areas. The location combines the best of both worlds: urban accessibility and leafy calm.
        </p>

        <div class="transit-section">
          <h3 data-de>Universitäten in der Nähe</h3>
          <h3 data-en>Nearby Universities</h3>
          <ul class="transit-list">
            <li>
              <span class="transit-icon">◆</span>
              <span data-de><strong>Freie Universität Berlin</strong> — ca. 10 Min. zu Fuß / mit dem Fahrrad</span>
              <span data-en><strong>Freie Universität Berlin</strong> — approx. 10 min on foot / by bicycle</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="transit-icon">◆</span>
              <span data-de><strong>MSB Medical School Berlin</strong> — in unmittelbarer Nähe</span>
              <span data-en><strong>MSB Medical School Berlin</strong> — in the immediate vicinity</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="transit-section">
          <h3 data-de>ÖPNV-Anbindung</h3>
          <h3 data-en>Public Transport</h3>
          <ul class="transit-list">
            <li>
              <span class="transit-badge ubahn">U3</span>
              <span data-de>Freie Universität (Thielplatz) — ca. 8 Min. zu Fuß</span>
              <span data-en>Freie Universität (Thielplatz) — approx. 8 min on foot</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="transit-badge ubahn">U3</span>
              <span data-de>Dahlem Dorf — ca. 12 Min. zu Fuß</span>
              <span data-en>Dahlem Dorf — approx. 12 min on foot</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="transit-badge sbahn">S1</span>
              <span data-de>Botanischer Garten — ca. 15 Min. zu Fuß</span>
              <span data-en>Botanischer Garten — approx. 15 min on foot</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Map -->
      <div class="map-wrap">
        <!--
          Replace the src below with your actual Google Maps embed URL.
          Go to Google Maps → search your address → Share → Embed a map → copy the src="..." value.
          For custom pins (villa + transit stops + FU), create a Google My Maps at mymaps.google.com
          and use that embed URL instead.
        -->
        <iframe
          class="map-iframe"
          src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Haderslebener+Stra%C3%9Fe+26,+12163+Berlin&output=embed&z=15"
          width="100%"
          height="480"
          style="border:0;"
          allowfullscreen
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          title="Karte: Villa Theo, Berlin Steglitz-Dahlem"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
.page-header-inner {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  gap: 1rem;
}
.lage-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: start;
}
.lage-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; }
.lage-text > p { color: var(--muted); }
.transit-section h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.transit-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; }
.transit-list li { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.transit-icon { color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; top: -0.2em; }
.transit-badge {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  padding: 0.2em 0.5em;
  border-radius: 3px;
  min-width: 2rem;
  text-align: center;
}
.ubahn { background: #005CA9; color: #fff; }
.sbahn { background: #008D4F; color: #fff; }
.map-wrap {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.map-iframe { display: block; }
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .lage-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
